ে Descriptive Statistics\" data-en=\"Descriptive Statistics with pandas\">Descriptive Statistics with pandas</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"distribution-analysis\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/distribution-analysis/\"><span>65</span><span data-bn=\"Distribution Analyze করুন\" data-en=\"Analyze Distributions\">Analyze Distributions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"segment-comparison\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/segment-comparison/\"><span>66</span><span data-bn=\"Segment Compare করুন\" data-en=\"Compare Segments\">Compare Segments</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"correlation-analysis\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/correlation-analysis/\"><span>67</span><span data-bn=\"Correlation Analysis\" data-en=\"Correlation Analysis\">Correlation Analysis</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-with-python\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/sampling-with-python/\"><span>68</span><span data-bn=\"Python দিয়ে Sampling\" data-en=\"Sampling with Python\">Sampling with Python</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"confidence-intervals-with-scipy\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/confidence-intervals-with-scipy/\"><span>69</span><span data-bn=\"SciPy দিয়ে Confidence Interval\" data-en=\"Confidence Intervals with SciPy\">Confidence Intervals with SciPy</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"hypothesis-tests-with-scipy\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/hypothesis-tests-with-scipy/\"><span>70</span><span data-bn=\"SciPy দিয়ে Hypothesis Test\" data-en=\"Hypothesis Tests with SciPy\">Hypothesis Tests with SciPy</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"simple-linear-regression\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/simple-linear-regression/\"><span>71</span><span data-bn=\"Simple Linear Regression\" data-en=\"Simple Linear Regression\">Simple Linear Regression</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"ab-test-analysis\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/ab-test-analysis/\"><span>72</span><span data-bn=\"A/B Test Analysis\" data-en=\"A/B Test Analysis\">A/B Test Analysis</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-label\"><span>07</span><strong data-bn=\"Matplotlib দিয়ে Visualization\" data-en=\"Visualization with Matplotlib\">Visualization with Matplotlib</strong></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"matplotlib-figure-and-axes\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/matplotlib-figure-and-axes/\"><span>73</span><span data-bn=\"Matplotlib Figure ও Axes\" data-en=\"Matplotlib Figure and Axes\">Matplotlib Figure and Axes</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"line-charts\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/line-charts/\"><span>74</span><span data-bn=\"Line Chart\" data-en=\"Line Charts\">Line Charts</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"bar-charts\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/bar-charts/\"><span>75</span><span data-bn=\"Bar Chart\" data-en=\"Bar Charts\">Bar Charts</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"histograms\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/histograms/\"><span>76</span><span data-bn=\"Histogram\" data-en=\"Histograms\">Histograms</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"box-plots\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/box-plots/\"><span>77</span><span data-bn=\"Box Plot\" data-en=\"Box Plots\">Box Plots</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"scatter-plots\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/scatter-plots/\"><span>78</span><span data-bn=\"Scatter Plot\" data-en=\"Scatter Plots\">Scatter Plots</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"subplots-and-small-multiples\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/subplots-and-small-multiples/\"><span>79</span><span data-bn=\"Subplot ও Small Multiple\" data-en=\"Subplots and Small Multiples\">Subplots and Small Multiples</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"labels-legends-and-annotations\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/labels-legends-and-annotations/\"><span>80</span><span data-bn=\"Label, Legend ও Annotation\" data-en=\"Labels, Legends, and Annotations\">Labels, Legends, and Annotations</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"responsible-chart-formatting\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/responsible-chart-formatting/\"><span>81</span><span data-bn=\"Responsible Chart Formatting\" data-en=\"Responsible Chart Formatting\">Responsible Chart Formatting</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"save-and-export-figures\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/save-and-export-figures/\"><span>82</span><span data-bn=\"Figure Save ও Export\" data-en=\"Save and Export Figures\">Save and Export Figures</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-label\"><span>08</span><strong data-bn=\"Time Series, Reproducibility ও Delivery\" data-en=\"Time Series, Reproducibility, and Delivery\">Time Series, Reproducibility, and Delivery</strong></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"datetime-index-and-time-series\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/datetime-index-and-time-series/\"><span>83</span><span data-bn=\"Datetime Index ও Time Series\" data-en=\"Datetime Index and Time Series\">Datetime Index and Time Series</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"resampling-time-series\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/resampling-time-series/\"><span>84</span><span data-bn=\"Time Series Resample করুন\" data-en=\"Resample Time Series\">Resample Time Series</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"rolling-windows\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/rolling-windows/\"><span>85</span><span data-bn=\"Rolling Window ও Moving Average\" data-en=\"Rolling Windows and Moving Averages\">Rolling Windows and Moving Averages</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-notebook-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/reproducible-notebook-workflow/\"><span>86</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Notebook Workflow\" data-en=\"Reproducible Notebook Workflow\">Reproducible Notebook Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"manage-environments-and-requirements\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/manage-environments-and-requirements/\"><span>87</span><span data-bn=\"Environment ও Requirement Manage\" data-en=\"Manage Environments and Requirements\">Manage Environments and Requirements</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"logging-and-quality-checks\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/logging-and-quality-checks/\"><span>88</span><span data-bn=\"Logging ও Quality Check\" data-en=\"Logging and Quality Checks\">Logging and Quality Checks</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"write-analytical-outputs\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/write-analytical-outputs/\"><span>89</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Output লিখুন\" data-en=\"Write Analytical Outputs\">Write Analytical Outputs</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"privacy-security-and-responsible-python\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/privacy-security-and-responsible-python/\"><span>90</span><span data-bn=\"Privacy, Security ও Responsible Python\" data-en=\"Privacy, Security, and Responsible Python\">Privacy, Security, and Responsible Python</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-label\"><span>09</span><strong data-bn=\"Python Analytics Portfolio Project\" data-en=\"Python Analytics Portfolio Project\">Python Analytics Portfolio Project</strong></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"python-project-brief-and-questions\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/python-project-brief-and-questions/\"><span>91</span><span data-bn=\"Portfolio Project Part 1: Brief ও Question\" data-en=\"Portfolio Project Part 1: Brief and Questions\">Portfolio Project Part 1: Brief and Questions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"python-project-clean-and-validate\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/python-project-clean-and-validate/\"><span>92</span><span data-bn=\"Portfolio Project Part 2: Clean ও Validate\" data-en=\"Portfolio Project Part 2: Clean and Validate\">Portfolio Project Part 2: Clean and Validate</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"python-project-analyze-and-visualize\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/python-project-analyze-and-visualize/\"><span>93</span><span data-bn=\"Portfolio Project Part 3: Analyze ও Visualize\" data-en=\"Portfolio Project Part 3: Analyze and Visualize\">Portfolio Project Part 3: Analyze and Visualize</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"python-project-report-and-publish\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/python-project-report-and-publish/\"><span>94</span><span data-bn=\"Portfolio Project Part 4: Report ও Publish\" data-en=\"Portfolio Project Part 4: Report and Publish\">Portfolio Project Part 4: Report and Publish</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/python-data-analytics/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/python-data-analytics/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/python-data-analytics/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/python-data-analytics/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"bar-charts\" data-tutorial=\"python-data-analytics\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Visualization with Matplotlib · Chapter 75 / 94\" data-en=\"Visualization with Matplotlib · Chapter 75 of 94\">Visualization with Matplotlib · Chapter 75 of 94</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Bar Chart\" data-en=\"Bar Charts\">Bar Charts</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Bar Chart ব্যবহার করে reproducible data analytics workflow তৈরি করার পদ্ধতি শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Bar charts compare magnitudes across discrete categories using length from a common baseline.\">Bar charts compare magnitudes across discrete categories using length from a common baseline.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 45 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"সহজ ভাষায় Bar Chart explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain Bar Charts in plain language.\">Explain Bar Charts in plain language.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Python example run ও modify করুন।\" data-en=\"Run and modify the Python example.\">Run and modify the Python example.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Analytical question-এ concept apply করুন।\" data-en=\"Apply the concept to an analytical question.\">Apply the concept to an analytical question.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Output validate করে একটি limitation communicate করুন।\" data-en=\"Validate the output and communicate one limitation.\">Validate the output and communicate one limitation.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Bar Chart কী\" data-en=\"What Bar Charts means\">What Bar Charts means</h2><p data-bn=\"Bar Chart data analytics workflow-এ কেন প্রয়োজন, কী input নেয়, কীভাবে process হয় এবং কী output দেয়—সেটি সহজ ভাষায় বুঝুন। বাস্তব কাজে question, row grain, input type ও validation check স্পষ্ট না হলে result ভুলভাবে interpret হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Bar charts compare magnitudes across discrete categories using length from a common baseline. In analytical work, bar charts should be connected to a clearly defined question, known row grain, and a validation check so the result can be reviewed and repeated.\">Bar charts compare magnitudes across discrete categories using length from a common baseline. In analytical work, bar charts should be connected to a clearly defined question, known row grain, and a validation check so the result can be reviewed and repeated.</p><div class=\"formula-block\"><span>Python</span><code>import pandas as pd\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\ndf = pd.read_csv('python_retail_sales.csv')\nsummary = df.groupby('region')['revenue'].sum().sort_values()\nfig, ax = plt.subplots()\nsummary.plot.barh(ax=ax)\nax.set(title='Revenue by region', xlabel='BDT', ylabel='Region')\nplt.show()</code><button aria-label=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy-code\" data-copy-code=\"\" type=\"button\">Copy</button></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Analyst কীভাবে ব্যবহার করেন\" data-en=\"How an analyst uses it\">How an analyst uses it</h2><p data-bn=\"Analyst Bar Chart ব্যবহার করার আগে business question ও data grain define করেন, code run করেন, output validate করেন এবং limitation লিখে রাখেন।\" data-en=\"Sort when ranking is important, keep a zero baseline, and limit categories to a readable count. Define the question and data grain first, then validate the output before interpretation.\">Sort when ranking is important, keep a zero baseline, and limit categories to a readable count. Define the question and data grain first, then validate the output before interpretation.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Rule, check ও common mistake\" data-en=\"Rules, checks, and common mistakes\">Rules, checks, and common mistakes</h2><p data-bn=\"Common mistake হলো inferred type trust করা, raw data বদলে ফেলা, long stateful notebook লেখা, missing value ignore করা, row ও group grain mix করা এবং validation ছাড়া output report করা।\" data-en=\"Common mistakes include trusting inferred data types, changing raw data, writing long stateful notebooks, ignoring missing values, confusing row and group grain, and reporting output without validation. Use small reproducible steps and preserve evidence.\">Common mistakes include trusting inferred data types, changing raw data, writing long stateful notebooks, ignoring missing values, confusing row and group grain, and reporting output without validation. Use small reproducible steps and preserve evidence.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Bar chart\" data-en=\"Bar chart\">Bar chart</h3><p data-bn=\"Bar chart: Categorical magnitude comparison. Chapter-এর example ও code দিয়ে term-টির ব্যবহার যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"Categorical magnitude comparison.\">Categorical magnitude comparison.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"baseline\" data-en=\"baseline\">baseline</h3><p data-bn=\"baseline: Axis value from which bar length begins. Chapter-এর example ও code দিয়ে term-টির ব্যবহার যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"Axis value from which bar length begins.\">Axis value from which bar length begins.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"category order\" data-en=\"category order\">category order</h3><p data-bn=\"category order: Sequence of categories in a chart. Chapter-এর example ও code দিয়ে term-টির ব্যবহার যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"Sequence of categories in a chart.\">Sequence of categories in a chart.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"horizontal bar\" data-en=\"horizontal bar\">horizontal bar</h3><p data-bn=\"horizontal bar: Bar extending along the x-axis. Chapter-এর example ও code দিয়ে term-টির ব্যবহার যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"Bar extending along the x-axis.\">Bar extending along the x-axis.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Worked example: Bar Chart\" data-en=\"Worked example: Bar Charts\">Worked example: Bar Charts</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একজন retail analyst supplied synthetic retail dataset-এ Bar Chart apply করে reproducible result তৈরি করবেন।\" data-en=\"A retail analyst applies bar charts to the supplied synthetic retail dataset and must produce a result another reviewer can rerun.\">A retail analyst applies bar charts to the supplied synthetic retail dataset and must produce a result another reviewer can rerun.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Analytical question, row grain, required field ও expected result লিখুন।\" data-en=\"State the analytical question, row grain, required fields, and expected result.\">State the analytical question, row grain, required fields, and expected result.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Starter code run করে output এবং underlying input inspect করুন।\" data-en=\"Run the starter code and inspect both the output and the underlying input.\">Run the starter code and inspect both the output and the underlying input.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"একটি value, condition বা parameter বদলে result কেন change হয় explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Change one value, condition, or parameter and explain why the result changes.\">Change one value, condition, or parameter and explain why the result changes.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Communicate করার আগে row count, total, type, assumption ও limitation validate করুন।\" data-en=\"Validate row counts, totals, types, assumptions, and limitations before communicating.\">Validate row counts, totals, types, assumptions, and limitations before communicating.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Bar Chart তখনই useful যখন code, data grain, validation evidence ও interpretation পরস্পরের সঙ্গে consistent।\" data-en=\"Bar Charts is useful only when code, data grain, validation evidence, and interpretation agree.\">Bar Charts is useful only when code, data grain, validation evidence, and interpretation agree.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/python-data-analytics/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Bar Chart business question ও data grain-এর সঙ্গে ব্যবহার করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"Bar charts compare magnitudes across discrete categories using length from a common baseline.\">Bar charts compare magnitudes across discrete categories using length from a common baseline.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Hidden state ও manual correction-এর বদলে explicit, readable, reproducible code ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"Prefer explicit, readable, reproducible code over hidden state and manual corrections.\">Prefer explicit, readable, reproducible code over hidden state and manual corrections.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Output trust করার আগে type, missing value, row count ও total inspect করুন।\" data-en=\"Inspect types, missing values, row counts, and totals before trusting output.\">Inspect types, missing values, row counts, and totals before trusting output.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Assumption, limitation, version ও evidence document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document assumptions, limitations, versions, and evidence.\">Document assumptions, limitations, versions, and evidence.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Python 3 documentation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://matplotlib.org/stable/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Matplotlib documentation ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/line-charts/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Line Chart\" data-en=\"Line Charts\">Line Charts</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/python-data-analytics/histograms/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Histogram\" data-en=\"Histograms\">Histograms</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/python-practice.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}